            "body": "The `explorer` is marked as `is_corrupted = true`:\n```lua\nH.explorer_normalize = function(explorer)\n  -- ...\n  for _, win_id in pairs(explorer.windows) do\n    if not H.is_valid_win(win_id) then explorer.is_corrupted = true end\n  end\n\n  return explorer\nend\n\n```\n\nWhich makes sense if `:q` is used.\n\nEdit:\n\nThe timer for keeping track of lost focus doesnt get stopped neither.",
